    <guid isPermaLink="false">67eff3d1f9578163d6087cc1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 05 Apr 2025 07:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期话题：在生活和学习上有通过什么娄子吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>标题事件指路<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a>近期的小篓子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a>吐槽工作和领导的朋友圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a>把消息误发到了大群里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a>收摊子故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a>小鹿收集的娄子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a>经典娄子之改备注</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a>出国前夜痛失护照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a>演出行业的大篓子，演出前竟发现…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a>琳琳子收的摊子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a>音响师的小篓子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a>在密室工作时同事帮忙收拾烂摊子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a>在舞台上会经常出现的娄子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>经典娄子——导演罢工后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a>怎么人在窗口就没了？艰难的复活之路</span></p>]]></description>
