  <item>
    <title>13.妇女节不聊鸡汤，只聊好物！10件提升生活幸福感的小确幸</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c841170766616acdd19e0d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c841170766616acdd19e0d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Mar 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a>今日话题：提升幸福感的好物分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a>房间装潢的好物分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a>消费可以带来幸福感（注重合理程度）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a>口口一の好物推荐——加湿器&amp;宝宝棉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">09:52</a>天依哥哥の氛围感好物推荐——线香</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">11:59</a>口口一の跨年旅行——大家的年头集体生病，后面一定会顺顺利利的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a>小鹿の好？物吐槽——毛绒玩具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a>琳琳子の好物推荐——地毯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a>关于盲盒的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1247">20:47</a>提升幸福感的居家好物——音响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a>听播客是一件能提升幸福感的事情，尤其是《黑猪杂谈》（）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a>和朋友们一起出去玩也可以让人感到幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1462">24:22</a>温馨的家让人幸福和不舍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a>阳光&amp;大自然会让人感到放松和幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1807">30:07</a>幸福时刻——休憩与美食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">33:11</a>结语：以上就是我们关于获得幸福感的好物与方式的分享~欢迎大家在评论区给我们分享，觉得什么东西可以提升幸福感~感谢大家收听~</span></p>]]></description>
