    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bab9a4606e5c59403beaf5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Feb 2025 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a>今日话题：电影重映背后的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a>大家都看了什么重映的电影？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a>大量电影重映的原因？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a>重映的原因有宣传系列电影，展现电影新技术，弥补票房成绩等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="653">10:53</a>为什么有的电影以前不受欢迎现在反而口碑变好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a>社会的文化需求在变化，小众文化变得流行。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a>近年来国产电影的受关注程度明显提高。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a>大家觉得现在市面上的电影和以前的有什么不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1407">23:27</a>女性导演以及关注女性相关议题的电影有所增加。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a>如果自己来拍电影有什么想拍的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a>一人推荐一部人生电影吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a>结语：以上就是我们关于电影重映的讨论~如果大家还有什么独到的见解，欢迎大家在评论区给我们留言~感谢大家收听~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66d4440bb60f52e46d7c9879/lnTEGu50-ihieCIuWs_Y-MDiVHZL.m4a" length="29619198" type="audio/mp4"/>
