    <guid isPermaLink="false">6757e766bdb9877a97bad405</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Dec 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a>今日话题：看观察类节目时，会不会从别人身上发现一些自己从没发现的缺点？（寻找自己的“影子”）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a>“留几手”刘爽：“面子，里子，票子都要”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">05:12</a>葛夕：“痛苦过，打碎重生，充满成长”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a>麦琳：“贴近于生活中大家能接触到的人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a>透过麦琳：“希望博得别人的关注”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>透过葛夕：“敏感地察觉到别人的情绪”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="858">14:18</a>面对别人的倾诉，不知道如何帮助</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a>透过麦琳：“在别人身上看到自己的影子——强势”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a>学会在事情中反省自己而不是生闷气~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a>良好的引导比强势的压迫会带来更好的结果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1746">29:06</a>关于杨子：“拥有自己的认知逻辑”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a>结语</span></p>]]></description>
