  <item>
    <title>06.偶像粉丝双视角：谈戒断反应、求饭撒，你追星时有多疯狂？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672b2bb06c53cd405a5d6df7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672b2bb06c53cd405a5d6df7</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Nov 2024 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a>今日话题：站在“粉丝”和“偶像”两个身份谈“追星”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a>大家各自的追星历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a>追星过程中有没有做过一些自认为比较疯狂的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a>谈论关于追星中如何看待偶像的对应、饭撒，粉丝之间互相“攀比”的行为。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a>如何压制自己追星时的疯狂念头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a>作为偶像的时候有没有遇到一些认为比较疯狂的粉丝行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2163">36:03</a>给追星的大家的一些建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2544">42:24</a>追星的“戒断反应”，偶像的戒断反应是什么样的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>结语：希望大家理智追星，快乐追星，快乐生活~</span></p>]]></description>
