    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期话题：发现自己的好朋友和自己讨厌/合不来/不喜欢的人成为了朋友怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a>自我介绍：谢天依、潘璐瑶、陈琳&amp;吕一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a>关于友情的联合投稿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【女团有真友谊吗？谈心之后友谊破裂｜如何维护随时会破裂的四人友情？健康的友情观】</span><br><span></span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1U841127dN" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1U841127dN"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a>是从什么契机变成亲近的朋友的？（四个咸鱼脑子）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a>在团时期，发现自己的好朋友和自己不喜欢的人成为了朋友怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a>在工作&amp;交友当中需不需要给朋友设定一些界限？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a>关于友情看法的转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a>认为在偶像女团/职场能交到真朋友吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3193">53:13</a>结尾</span></p>]]></description>
